e county&rsquo;s 6 grids has come in under 90% of normal in February to March 39 times in 75 years since 1951. Last year, 2025, Feb-Mar ran 32% of normal on that middle, and in 2026 so far it ran 15%. May to June is the wettest pair at 8.08 inches normal, and May to June 2026 came in at 188%. Every grid had its driest year in 1956, with grid 22928 lowest at 45%.</p>"}
